===Language===
[[Byrakan language|Byrakan]] is a [[FAMILY language]], sometimes classified as a [[SUB-FAMILY language]], while other sources emphasize its close relationship with the [[OTHER SUB-FAMILY language]] group. [[Qymish language|Qymish]] has certain characteristics of Byrakan origin. U/C

